# Ephemeral git worktrees created for isolated agent runs. These are
# scratch checkouts (each holds a .git pointer file, not real content)
# and are removed when the run finishes — never commit them. Scoped to
# the worktrees subdir so genuine project config under .claude/
# (settings, skills, agents) can still be tracked.
.claude/worktrees/
